sequenceDiagram
    participant Analyst
    participant API as FastAPI / Playbook Engine
    participant Bus as M03 AsyncEventBus
    participant Conn as OSINT Connector (e.g., crtsh_ct / gleif_lei)
    participant IE as M04 Hybrid Extractor (Regex + GLiNER)
    participant ER as M05 Blocked Fellegi-Sunter EM
    participant Fusion as M06 W3C PROV & Subjective Logic
    participant DB as M02 SQLite WAL + FTS5 + Vec

    Analyst->>API: POST /api/v2/collect/playbook (target="example.org", depth=2)
    API->>Bus: Emit Seed Event (Domain: "example.org", hop=0)
    Bus->>Conn: Acquire TokenBucket + Check CircuitBreaker
    Conn->>DB: Store RawEvidenceRecord (SHA-256 + Headers + LineageFamily)
    Conn->>IE: Pass Raw Payload / Document Bytes
    IE->>IE: Defang Normalize + Regex + ONNX INT8 GLiNER Spans
    IE->>ER: Candidate Entities & Claims (with Staging check if >50)
    ER->>DB: Lookup 3-Pass Blocking Keys (Sorted Neighborhood w=15 + MinHash)
    ER->>ER: Compute Fellegi-Sunter EM Log2 Weights & IEF Adjustment
    ER->>Fusion: Canonical Entity IDs + Claim Attestations
    Fusion->>Fusion: Compute Dong Independence Weight I(e) + Jøsang Opinion ω=(b,d,u,a)
    Fusion->>Fusion: Assign Epistemic Status (OBSERVED_FACT / CORROBORATED_FACT / CONFLICT)
    Fusion->>DB: Commit Entities, Bitemporal Claims, FTS5 BM25 & INT8 Vectors
    DB-->>Analyst: Stream Progress via WebSocket & Render WebGL Graph
